    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-08-08T09:36:45+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-08T09:36:45+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-08T00:06:45Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-08T00:06:45Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A weak high pressure system centred over NSW and a cold front approaching from the west result in a northerly airstream over SA this morning. The vigorous cold front will move across the west late Saturday then moving across remaining parts of the State on Sunday. A high pressure system moves just to the north on Monday, ahead of another cold front forecast to move across South Australia on Tuesday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW008" description="Mid North" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <warning-summary type="sheep_graziers_warning" start-time-local="2026-08-08T03:36:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-10T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-07T18:06:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-09T14:30:00Z">Warning to Sheep Graziers</warning-summary>
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-08-08T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-09T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-07T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-08T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Very high chance of rain. Winds northerly 20 to 30 km/h. Daytime maximum temperatures between 14 and 17.</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 10:50am to 2:00pm, UV Index predicted to reach 4 [Moderate]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-08-09T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-10T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-08T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-09T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Very high chance of rain. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning. Winds northerly 20 to 30 km/h turning west to northwesterly 30 to 45 km/h in the late morning and early afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 7 and 10 with daytime temperatures reaching between 13 and 16.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-08-10T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-11T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-09T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-10T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Very high chance of showers, most likely in the morning. Winds west to southwesterly 30 to 45 km/h decreasing to 25 to 40 km/h during the morning then turning northwesterly 15 to 20 km/h during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 3 and 7 with daytime temperatures reaching between 11 and 15.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-08-11T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-12T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-10T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-11T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Very high chance of showers, most likely in the afternoon and evening. The chance of a thunderstorm in the west in the afternoon. Winds northwesterly 15 to 25 km/h increasing to 25 to 40 km/h during the morning then turning westerly 20 to 30 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 3 and 6 with daytime temperatures reaching between 13 and 17.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
